== OUT/pkg/sub.broken.md
# Module `pkg.sub.broken`

A module with a type error still has documentation: <b>escaped</b> & all.

## fn `wrong`

```checkers
fn wrong x -> y : x~Int, y~Int
```

Returns a `String` where an `Int` is expected.

## enum `Kind`

```checkers
enum Kind
    Round
    Square
```

Shapes' kinds.

